plore Pune's top residential projects with world-class lifestyle amenities, including clubhouses, sports facilities, and smart home features.","score":0.3068494,"raw_content":null,"id":"32ad28-05"},{"url":"https://orogroup.in/top-amenities-in-luxury-apartments-2026","title":"Top Amenities to Look for in Luxury Apartments in 2026","content":"### Kids Play Area\n\nThe amenities in this family-friendly gated community make the project even more appealing.\n\nFamily-oriented amenities include:\n\n Play areas outside\n Lawn area\n Safe surfaces\n Interactive systems\n Learning environments\n\n### Sports and Recreation Facilities\n\nFitness and recreation are key factors in buying decisions. \n\nThe components usually present in most luxurious residential projects are:\n\n Tennis courts\n Badminton courts\n Indoor games\n Table tennis areas\n Sports courts for involvement in the community\n\nFamilies and investors are drawn to active lifestyle features.\n\n### Co-working and Business Lounge\n\nThe culture of remote work has altered consumer expectations.\n\nThese days, more and more high-end apartment buildings have: [...] Oro Group\n\n Home\n About Us\n Projects\n  + Residential Projects\n    - Ajit Oro Atlantis\n    - Oro Elements\n    - Ajit Oro County\n    - Oro Dynasty\n    - Oro Constella\n    - EWS/LIG\n       Oro Aakriti\n       Oro Utsav\n  + Commercial Projects\n    - Oro Atrium\n  + Completed Projects\n    - Oro County\n    - Oro Elements\n    - Oro City\n    - Oro Atrium\n    - Oro Aakriti\n  + Upcoming Projects\n    - Group Housing – CG City\n    - Township – Dewa Road\n    - Township – Jail Road\n Events\n Contact Us\n\nOro Group [...] Luxury apartments with swimming pools attract families and affluent clients seeking resort-style living in high-end residential projects in Lucknow. \n\n### Fully Equipped Gym and Fitness Center\n\nWellness is what luxurious lifestyles entail in 2026.\n\nIn today’s time, there are luxurious developments that include:\n\n Gymnasium equipment\n Cardiovascular sections\n Strength sections\n Yoga deck\n Meditation room\n Personal training areas\n\nThese wellness features in apartments promote healthier lifestyles and eliminate the need for external memberships.\n\n### Landscaped Gardens and Green Open Spaces\n\nGreen living still influences consumer tastes.\n\nMore and more luxury developments incorporate:","score":0.29902378,"raw_content":null,"id":"3b9af6-06"},{"url":"https://wavecityghaziabad.in","title":"Wave City Ghaziabad – Premium Smart Township on NH-24","content":"Yes, all residential projects at Wave City Ghaziabad are RERA approved under the Uttar Pradesh Real Estate Regulatory Authority (UP RERA), ensuring full legal compliance and buyer protection.\n\nWave City provides world-class amenities including a clubhouse, swimming pool, gymnasium, landscaped parks, 24/7 security with CCTV, fiber-optic internet, automated street and water lighting, power backup, waste management systems, and retail facilities within the township.\n\nWave City is a pre-certified LEED Platinum-rated green township — the highest level of green building certification. Over 1,470 acres within the township are dedicated to pristine greenery, parks, and open spaces. [...] Platinum Green\n\nPre-certified LEED Platinum–rated township with 1,470 acres of pristine greenery.\n\nSmart Security\n\n24/7 CCTV surveillance, gated perimeter, and fiber-optic smart city infrastructure.\n\nHi-Tech Living\n\nAutomated street lighting, smart metering, and uninterrupted power backup.\n\nAward-Winning\n\nRecognized as one of NCR's best planned townships with world-class road infrastructure.\n\nExplore All Projects\n\nFeatures & Facilities\n\n## An Urban Oasis — Unparalleled Lifestyle\n\nCharacterized by pristine greenery and designed with modern amenities and infrastructure, Wave City is an urban oasis offering residents an unparalleled lifestyle — a perfect amalgamation of comfort, nature, and serenity.\n\nWave City clubhouse with swimming pool and landscaped gardens\n\nSwimming Pool [...] Swimming Pool\n\nModern Gymnasium\n\nLush Green Parks\n\nAmple Parking\n\nFiber-Optic Internet\n\n24/7 CCTV Security\n\nPower Backup\n\nWaste Management\n\nRetail Galleria\n\nSchools Nearby\n\nHealthcare Facilities\n\nCommunity Clubhouse\n\n“Lush parks, clubhouse, pool and sports zones — everything for wellness. Self-sufficient community with power backup, waste management, and transport system.”\n\n— Anuj, Resident\n\nLocation Advantages\n\n## Excellently Connected, Perfectly Located\n\nExcellent connectivity via NH-24 and Delhi-Meerut Expressway. Schools, hospitals, and markets nearby — perfect for families and investors alike.\n\nNH-24 Connectivity\n\nDirect access to National Highway 24 — one of India's most modern expressways.\n\nDelhi-Meerut Expressway","score":0.25151023,"raw_content":null,"id":"509de5-07"}],"response_time":3.32,"request_id":"91675e75-58b2-4add-be83-645104c6035b"}